{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b1c8caf73588d7b8943741d46d6f87633735158d83a49305d52cd42b7ee95f6f", "ja": "（今日は、風花がプロデュースした服について\n取材がある。さて、風花の準備はできたかな？）", "zh": "（今天要接受关于风花亲自设计的服装的采访。好了，不知道风花准备好了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "569258c969083706e3a9b638c1578917070afed0b31500f6a67b788268201487", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}さん。\n準備できました。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n已经准备好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1002_p", "source_sha256": "297eb25d0cf5e5f846afa0a0f162bbff592e8043f9ca65b23d1c09968f5af0d9", "ja": "ああ、お疲れ様。\nちょうど様子を見に行こうと思ってたんだ。", "zh": "啊，辛苦了。\n我正好也打算去看看情况。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6913537141afc464c73fa78df1051bc1c7b97d037a92099ae1fe1f0250567076", "ja": "そうだったんですね。自分の考えた服を説明する\nなんて、初めての経験で……。", "zh": "原来是这样。要说明自己设计的服装，还是第一次经历这种事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7c058f19e5198b2a4a79a2a0d2be8141e758b8a3acda717c07e49479ce659d3d", "ja": "嬉しいんですけど、やっぱり緊張もあって……。\nこの形にたどり着くまで本当に大変でしたから。", "zh": "虽然很高兴，但果然还是会紧张……\n毕竟走到这一步，真的付出了很多努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1005_p", "source_sha256": "633bc2bd336bb8d7f77a9541cbbebe330bc8df114abfc8e7fd27ef6fb88853b5", "ja": "ああ……。\nデザインが固まるまで、何度もやり直してたもんな。", "zh": "啊……  \n在确定设计之前，你确实反复修改了很多次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1006_p", "source_sha256": "810229c2b08be01db1f1095a090fb127f624de9457c52e8ccca41f74e5fa8991", "ja": "中には、水着にネコ耳と尻尾をつけただけとか……。", "zh": "其中还有只是在泳装上加了猫耳和尾巴之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "183b9367c005f0dcd4c28727ae7b3c2ed2e9d3f490fe28e1402e069c900a703f", "ja": "あ、あ、あれは違うんです～！　すごく悩んでた時に\n莉緒さんと話してたら、なぜかあんな形に……。", "zh": "那、那、那个不一样啦～！我烦恼得特别厉害的时候，和莉绪姐聊着聊着，不知怎么就变成那种样子了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1008_p", "source_sha256": "cc0196ffff858c74bb05d31fa6804472d79389c5ae5d39e32d345920ed847184", "ja": "悩みすぎると迷走することもあるよな……。\nでも結果的に、納得できる仕上がりでよかったよ。", "zh": "烦恼过度的话，偶尔也会迷失方向啊……\n不过最后能做出令人满意的成果，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e3efeb16ad5ab93169548de870855cda22ed3f082b951f9dfc31c8704ae951a2", "ja": "はい。\n私のこだわりをいろいろ詰められて、大満足です♪", "zh": "是的。\n能把我坚持的各种细节都融入进去，我非常满意♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9c10da5fa1eb252a8aef4f67398b5b107bad6c6c7cf847102fcfb96f50c62440", "ja": "{$P$}さんはわかりますか？\n私が一番こだわったポイントがどこか……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生能看出来吗？\n我最讲究的地方在哪里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7214a2c6e2cb281567807bbdd66f1d652546d19e0c7cfb33bf76f2ef1e0dd506", "ja": "うーん、そうだな……。\n正統派アイドル的な感じかな？", "zh": "嗯——这个嘛……\n或许是正统派偶像的感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "077333e309692ff08b120f20d3d56515f4851f54440e5b1aeac5bfab743506c3", "ja": "ふふ、違います！　……あっ！\n正統派を目指したのは違わないんですけど……。", "zh": "呵呵，不对！……啊！\n虽然确实是以正统派偶像为目标……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5e071772bbcb8e3cc9e363d5d7619dc2f5aa705d7bc109016dfc63441e3f2ac5", "ja": "一番こだわったのは、ネコちゃんなんです。\nほら、襟元にちっちゃく……可愛いですよね♪", "zh": "我最在意的是小猫咪。\n你看，在领口那里小小的一只……很可爱吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e278d82b89d0375f49870ae24d882b623ee6cefa41337d6d5fa5095f8ccd415a", "ja": "確かに可愛いな。でもちょっと小さくないか？\nネコ好きをアピールするなら大きくても……。", "zh": "确实很可爱。不过是不是有点太小了？\n要是想展示自己喜欢猫的话，大一点也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "073a8b0901395c13922bb555f97e963c13a0d2ace4f347eb9400ae77d15818ca", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、わかってません！\nこういうのは、小さい方がいいんです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生根本就不懂！\n这种东西，就是要小巧一点才好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9b8c38d41a1ebc3455f1b8400076a44f16f69a8b831ddfd4f8dc1ef8db20eaf3", "ja": "（風花に怒られた……！）", "zh": "（被风花训了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5a5d9978ae784fc1a3314871c0faa7eafd74734342eaa05e220450e9a9f75201", "ja": "街中でネコちゃんに遭遇したら、「やったぁ♪\n今日はいい日かも！」って思いますよね？", "zh": "在街上遇到小猫咪的话，会觉得\"太棒了♪今天说不定是个好日子！\"对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ca64b119224392aaeb716981f8e731daf1077a8d25151d3a1bdf1c120ad6430d", "ja": "この服を見た人が、ネコちゃんを見つけた時、\nそんな風に喜んでもらえたらいいなって……。", "zh": "要是看到这身衣服的人发现了小猫，也能像那样高兴就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1019_p", "source_sha256": "06642fdee7fa4919c2d9eaa1965b278bf13adb6f0e7525eab1ca303c6be5a551", "ja": "な、なるほど……。\n小さくて、さりげない感じがいいんだな。", "zh": "原、原来如此……。\n小巧又不显眼的感觉比较好，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "80ba4fb9cef5325f0b0e80df35a1aa58d6373df02a794619021f89539b62362e", "ja": "はい！　それにネコちゃんを好きな気持ちが\nきちんとアピールできます、し……って、ああっ！", "zh": "是的！而且还能好好表达出你喜欢猫咪的心情……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "cc83419a14fd0361c79e63faba4b8ae4f22d2522ebb9eca416bab405b7a968f5", "ja": "わ、私ったらごめんなさい！\nつい熱が入っちゃって。わかってない、なんて……。", "zh": "我、我真是对不起！\n一不小心就太激动了。居然还说了“根本不懂”这种话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1022_p", "source_sha256": "68530c24fc34a23a68766101fc14b7b9ad930a9d4699f02b4e02808f6bf05fdb", "ja": "いや、構わないよ。風花のこだわりが知れたから。\nできれば話の続きは、取材の時に語ってほしいな。", "zh": "不，没关系。我也了解了风花的坚持。\n可以的话，希望你在采访时再讲讲后续。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4943f10ab0489eb1d205e5c201caad834697eab7789ebea92050bb659a8ec92b", "ja": "そうですね。取材用に話をとっておかないと。\nうう、猫のことになると本当に……。", "zh": "是啊，得把这些话留到采访时再说才行。\n呜，一说到猫咪就真的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0524_1024_p", "source_sha256": "b3c41d08c7bfaef4b94ef7b0e4bf835649e598e1d0aa923ccd25e0ac31060615", "ja": "（思わず声を出してしまうくらいのネコちゃん愛。\nきっと風花の思いは、ファンにも伝わるはずだ！）", "zh": "（这是连自己都不由得发出声音的猫咪之爱。\n风花的心意一定也能传达给粉丝们！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
